OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies warn of more deaths
OL,4,Awithout MLD screening
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies whose children have
OL,7,Fmetachromatic leukodystrophy (MLD) have
OL,8,Fwarned it will be too late for many to
OL,9,Freceive treatment unless a review into
OL,10,Fnewborn screening is brought forward.
OL,12,FMLD is a genetic condition which
OL,13,Faffects the brain and nervous system,
OL,14,Fcausing a progressive loss of physical
OL,15,Fand mental abilities - it affects
OL,16,Froughly one in 40,000 children.
OL,18,FA treatment called Libmeldy on the NHS
OL,19,Fcan save children's lives if it is
OL,20,Fcaught early enough.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
