OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies warn of more deaths
OL,4,Awithout MLD screening
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK National Screening Committee's
OL,7,Freview opted against newborn screening
OL,8,Fover uncertainties about test accuracy,
OL,9,Fcost, and the effectiveness of treating
OL,10,Fthe condition before symptoms start.
OL,11,FThe next review is due between 2029 to
OL,12,F2030.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
